.TH LOGIC 1
.SH NAME
logic \- read portable Logic, roff man, and GNU Info manuals
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B logic
.RB [ \-\-type " auto|logic|man|info" ]
.RB [ \-\-format " text|json" ]
.I source
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads a Logic Manual v1 document, roff man-page source, or GNU Info source
file. The auto type uses the filename extension when possible. Text is the
default output; JSON exposes the shared document model.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR man2logic (1),
.BR info2logic (1)
